OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1786637920
OL,3,COxford Street set to get permanent
OL,4,Clive facial recognition cameras
OL,6,FLive facial recognition cameras are
OL,7,Fset to be used on the UK's busiest
OL,8,Fshopping street, the Mayor of London
OL,9,Fhas appeared to confirm.
OL,11,FThe Metropolitan Police has already
OL,12,Fsaid it wants to expand the use of the
OL,13,Ftechnology in the capital, and Sir
OL,14,FSadiq Khan has indicated that the
OL,15,Fnewly pedestrianised Oxford Street
OL,16,Fwill be included.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G1/13
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,379,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37802
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1786637920
OL,3,COxford Street set to get permanent
OL,4,Clive facial recognition cameras
OL,6,FIt would be among the first areas in
OL,7,Fthe country to have permanent live
OL,8,Ffacial recognition (LFR)
OL,9,Finfrastructure scanning the faces of
OL,10,Fpeople passing and comparing them with
OL,11,Fa watchlist of wanted suspects.
OL,13,FThe cameras would likely be attached
OL,14,Fto street furniture such as lampposts
OL,15,Frather than a temporary police van, as
OL,16,Fhas been the case up until now.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G2/13
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,379,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37803
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1786637920
OL,3,COxford Street set to get permanent
OL,4,Clive facial recognition cameras
OL,6,FLFR has been widely criticised by
OL,7,Fhuman rights groups, with one
OL,8,Forganisation describing the Oxford
OL,9,FStreet rollout as an escalation in
OL,10,Froutine public surveillance.
OL,12,FScotland Yard plans to use static live
OL,13,Ffacial recognition cameras in London's
OL,14,FWest End and Soho ` which have some of
OL,15,Fthe highest crime rates in London.
OL,17,FDuring a routine City Hall session
OL,18,Flast month, Sir Sadiq was asked about
OL,19,Fthe rollout of LFR in the West End.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G3/13
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,379,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37804
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1786637920
OL,3,COxford Street set to get permanent
OL,4,Clive facial recognition cameras
OL,6,FHe said: "The Met is working really
OL,7,Fclosely with the Oxford Street
OL,8,FDevelopment Corporation about how,
OL,9,Fwhen we pedestrianise that street, we
OL,10,Fuse LFR in a sensible way, using the
OL,11,Fopportunity of new CCTV to use LFR.
OL,13,F"It is right and proper we should let
OL,14,Fthe public know LFR is being used. The
OL,15,FMet is very good at testing on
OL,16,Findividual sites before rolling out.
OL,18,F"What we do not do is a big bang as it
OL,19,Fwould be a disaster. I am confident
OL,20,Fthat we will have a good rollout in
OL,21,Fthe West End."
OL,26,@nD@JOUuD@AOUzD@AOU}D@NO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G4/13
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,379,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37805
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1786637920
OL,3,COxford Street set to get permanent
OL,4,Clive facial recognition cameras
OL,6,FRuth Ehrlich, from human rights
OL,7,Forganisation Liberty, told the Press
OL,8,FAssociation: "The prospect of
OL,9,Fpermanent live facial recognition
OL,10,Fcameras being introduced on Oxford
OL,11,FStreet marks a significant expansion
OL,12,Fof surveillance in public spaces.
OL,14,F"This technology scans the faces of
OL,15,Feveryone who passes by, regardless of
OL,16,Fwhether they are suspected of any
OL,17,Fwrongdoing.
OL,26,@pD@NOUvD@AOU
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G5/13
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,379,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37806
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1786637920
OL,3,COxford Street set to get permanent
OL,4,Clive facial recognition cameras
OL,6,F"If live facial recognition is to be
OL,7,Fdeployed in one of the country's
OL,8,Fbusiest shopping and tourist
OL,9,Fdestinations, there must be full
OL,10,Ftransparency about how it will be
OL,11,Fused, what safeguards are in place,
OL,12,Fand how its impact on people's rights
OL,13,Fwill be monitored.
OL,15,F"The Government has promised a legal
OL,16,Fframework for live facial recognition.
OL,17,FThe Met should not be rolling out more
OL,18,Fof this technology before that
OL,19,Fframework is in place.
OL,26,@nD@AOUwD@AOU
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G6/13
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,379,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37807
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1786637920
OL,3,COxford Street set to get permanent
OL,4,Clive facial recognition cameras
OL,6,F"Permanent cameras on Oxford Street
OL,7,Fwould be a significant escalation in
OL,8,Four nation's capital."
OL,10,FRecent polling commissioned by Liberty
OL,11,Fsuggested that 48% of people oppose
OL,12,Fscanning the faces of those walking on
OL,13,Fhigh streets when there is no
OL,14,Fsuspected imminent threat.
OL,16,FJasleen Chaggar, from the campaign
OL,17,Fgroup Big Brother Watch, urged the
OL,18,Fmayor to abandon the idea.
OL,26,@nD@AOUpD@VO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G7/13
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,379,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37808
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1786637920
OL,3,COxford Street set to get permanent
OL,4,Clive facial recognition cameras
OL,6,F"Plans to turn the newly walkable
OL,7,FOxford Street into a permanent digital
OL,8,Fpolice line-up using live facial
OL,9,Frecognition software would be a
OL,10,Fmistake," she said.
OL,12,F"Innocent Londoners who are not
OL,13,Fsuspected of any crime by the police
OL,14,Fshould be able to wander around public
OL,15,Fspaces without identifying themselves
OL,16,Fto the authorities.
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@IO]tD@AOU
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G8/13
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,379,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37809
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1786637920
OL,3,COxford Street set to get permanent
OL,4,Clive facial recognition cameras
OL,6,F"A face scan is as unique as a
OL,7,Ffingerprint. The police cannot take
OL,8,Fyour fingerprints when you are not
OL,9,Fsuspected of wrongdoing. Taking a
OL,10,Ffaceprint is no less intrusive just
OL,11,Fbecause it happens remotely.
OL,13,F"The West End rivals the best cities
OL,14,Fin the world for its culture and
OL,15,Fnightlife. The mayor should abandon
OL,16,Fthe plans to roll out Orwellian
OL,17,Fbiometric software which would instead
OL,18,Fplace London in the company of
OL,19,Fauthoritarian regimes."
OL,26,@nD@AOUuD@AOU{D@WO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G9/13
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,379,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37810
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1786637920
OL,3,COxford Street set to get permanent
OL,4,Clive facial recognition cameras
OL,6,FThe Met used fixed cameras during a
OL,7,Fsix-month pilot in Croydon, south
OL,8,FLondon, between October 2025 and May
OL,9,F2026 which saw 173 people arrested
OL,10,Fincluding a woman who had been wanted
OL,11,Ffor more than 20 years.
OL,13,FCommissioner Sir Mark Rowley has
OL,14,Fdescribed it as "one of the most
OL,15,Frevolutionary technology advances in
OL,16,Fpolicing in recent years", with the
OL,17,Fforce arresting more than 2,000 people
OL,18,Fusing LFR cameras since the start of
OL,19,F2024.
OL,26,@vD@QOUxD@YO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                G10/13
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,379,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37811
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1786637920
OL,3,COxford Street set to get permanent
OL,4,Clive facial recognition cameras
OL,6,FThe technology has also started to be
OL,7,Fdeployed at London's Tube stations
OL,8,Fthis month.
OL,10,FA spokesperson for the Mayor of London
OL,11,Fsaid: "The mayor is committed to
OL,12,Ftransforming Oxford Street into a
OL,13,Fworld-class, pedestrian-friendly and
OL,14,Fsafe destination.
OL,16,F"As part of delivering that, the mayor
OL,17,Fis working with the Met, West End
OL,18,FTaskforce and Oxford Street
OL,19,FDevelopment Corporation on making best
OL,20,Fuse of technology.
OL,26,@sD@GOUxD@AOU
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                G11/13
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,379,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37812
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1786637920
OL,3,COxford Street set to get permanent
OL,4,Clive facial recognition cameras
OL,6,F"Backed by record funding from City
OL,7,FHall, the Met are leading the way in
OL,8,Fusing the latest technology, including
OL,9,Fe-bikes, drones and live facial
OL,10,Frecognition, to arrest dangerous
OL,11,Fcriminals and tackle and prevent
OL,12,Fviolence in the capital.
OL,14,F"In Westminster, neighbourhood crime
OL,15,Fhas fallen, with 14,000 fewer offences
OL,16,Fin the past year and the Met's rollout
OL,17,Fof live facial recognition in the West
OL,18,FEnd and Soho will help drive down
OL,19,Fcrime rates even further.
OL,26,@nD@AOUvD@AOU
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                G12/13
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,379,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37813
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1786637920
OL,3,COxford Street set to get permanent
OL,4,Clive facial recognition cameras
OL,6,F"The mayor is committed to ensuring
OL,7,Fthe Met is open and transparent around
OL,8,Fwhere, when, why and how live facial
OL,9,Frecognition technology is used.
OL,11,F"His Office for Policing and Crime
OL,12,Fwill continue to scrutinise and
OL,13,Foversee its use to ensure there's
OL,14,Ftrust and confidence in policing, as
OL,15,Fwe continue to build a safer London
OL,16,Ffor everyone."
OL,18,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,19,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,20,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,21,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@AOUxD@NO]
